        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "weber REP 932 (civil-engineering concrete 0-12 mm) is a dry product containing civil-engineering cement that is mixed with water only into a ready-to-use, free-flowing concrete. It is resistant in sulphate-containing environments and has very good salt-frost resistance. Compressive strength class C50/60 at flowable consistency, repair class R4 to EN 1504-3. Recommended for casting from 50 mm.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "High-grade casting concrete from 50 mm",
            "CEM I Portland cement",
